WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.100
Final Assessment.

00:00:02.050 --> 00:00:05.175
The institution must earn the uniform.

00:00:05.175 --> 00:00:08.100
The red serge is a symbol of trust.

00:00:08.100 --> 00:00:20.400
That trust has been broken by decades of documented failure — sexual harassment, political interference, intelligence failures, and the deaths of citizens the RCMP was sworn to protect.

00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:23.575
The institution cannot reform itself.

00:00:23.575 --> 00:00:28.675
External, binding, enforceable oversight is the only path forward.
